# Spring Boot Product API

REST API built with Spring Boot, PostgreSQL and JWT authentication.

## Features

- Product CRUD
- Pagination & sorting
- JWT authentication
- Role-based authorization
- Swagger/OpenAPI
- Validation
- Global exception handling

## Tech Stack

- Java 21
- Spring Boot 3
- PostgreSQL
- Spring Security
- JWT
- Maven

## Run locally

1. Clone repository
2. Configure application.properties
3. Run PostgreSQL
4. Start application

## API Docs

http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui/index.html